43	     * {@code possibleDuplicate} true and {@code possibleDuplicateOf} to the earliest existing owner
44	     * that shares the candidate's last name and postcode but has a different telephone; otherwise
45	     * sets {@code possibleDuplicate} false and leaves {@code possibleDuplicateOf} unset.
46	     *
47	     * @param candidate the owner about to be created, with its fields already normalized
48	     */
